					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi literas tuas amicissimas et gracias primum ago et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>habeo propter significationem novarum, quae tibi constare potuerunt.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Mirum vero artificium Satanae <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> declaratum, ci se organum <lb xml:id="p1z4"/><persName>Tammerus</persName> praebuit, nefarius syncerae religionis praevaricator relaturus <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>cum <persName>Iuda</persName>, nisi mature resipisceret, dignum impietatis praemium.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Nihil non tentat ea pestilentiae sedes confundenda potenti manu <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>excelsi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Instat urgetque pontifex apud Ferdinandumet eius ge<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nerum <persName>Albertum</persName>, <placeName ref="l619">Bavariae</placeName> ducem, ne pientissimis suorum postulatis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>acquiescant; nam et nobilitas <placeName ref="l619">Bavarica</placeName> idem a suo duce <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>contendit, quod <placeName ref="l850">Austriaca</placeName> a rege <persName ref="p20743">Ferdinando</persName>; sed pro <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>utroque per literas et legatos respondet bestia, quod ad se, non <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad principes spectet religionis administratio.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l303">Magdenburgenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>cum suo archiepiscopo et electoribus <placeName ref="l749">Saxone</placeName> et <placeName ref="l1048">Brandenburgense</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>de controversia transegerunt, quam habuerunt gravem et ad bellum spectantem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Sunt, qui augurentur ducem <persName>Volphgangum</persName> <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinum</placeName> bello <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>petiturum fines <placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName> cardinalis, eo quid <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nescio quid machinatus sit contra <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinos</placeName> comites.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Norici <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>implorant auxilia; sed nescitur contra quem; adeo varie aestuant <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>res <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Pro libris ad te non scripsissem, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>si scivissem donaturum; accipio tamen donum animo gratissimo <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>idque ita, ut de gratitudinis significatione sim cogitaturus, sicuti <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>par est.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo Iesu, quia pluribus non possum propter <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>capitis vertiginem; antehac inconsuetam mihi pati hodie cępi.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Salvos iube meis verbis amanter tuos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName> 26. februarii <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>anno 1556.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Qui has perfert, iuvenis vere pius est bonorum omnium <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>testimonio; quem tibi commendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p3099">Sulcerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Viro clarissimo d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori vigilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et symmistae <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>colendissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
